# Executables and Installer Binaries (Avoid pushing large files to GitHub)
*.exe
*.exe~
NeoBox-Go.exe
NeoBox_Setup_v*.exe

# Wails and Frontend Build Output
build/bin/

# frontend/dist holds the built frontend, which main.go embeds with
# //go:embed all:frontend/dist. Go's embed fails the build outright when the
# pattern matches nothing, so a clean clone could not even run `go build ./...`
# or `go test ./...` until npm had produced the directory. The generated files
# stay ignored; the placeholder is tracked so the pattern always matches.
#
# The placeholder also exists at frontend/public/.gitkeep, which is what keeps
# it alive: vite empties dist/ on every build and then copies public/ into it,
# so the tracked copy is restored instead of disappearing from the working tree.
#
# Note the trailing /* — with a plain `frontend/dist/` git never descends into
# the directory and the negation below would have no effect.
frontend/dist/*
!frontend/dist/.gitkeep

# Runtime artifact left by builds from before InitTray started writing the toast
# icon into the user data directory. Kept ignored so an old copy in a working
# tree does not show up as an untracked file; the icons that ship with the app
# are build/windows/icon.ico and icon-off.ico, and both stay tracked.
/icon.ico

# Dependency Directories
node_modules/
frontend/node_modules/

# User, Temporary and Agent-Specific Data
test_user_data/
.antigravitycli/
.claude/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Go Build and Test Artifacts
*.test
*.out

# Cryptographic Keys and Signatures (Never commit secrets or temporary release signatures)
*.sig
*.key
*.pem
private_key*

# Design system record and its sidecar. Оба файла адресованы агентам, а не
# сборке: DESIGN.md описывает визуальную систему, .impeccable/design.json
# несёт то, что не помещается в его фронтматтер.
DESIGN.md
.impeccable/
